---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DocumentContent from "../../components/DocumentContent.astro";
import { parseDocument } from "../../utils/parseDocument.js";

const markdown = `
:::concordance
## Source

First stanza, first line.  
First stanza, second line.

Second stanza, first line.  
Second stanza, second line.

## Target

Primera estrofa, primera línea.  
Primera estrofa, segunda línea.

Segunda estrofa, primera línea.  
Segunda estrofa, segunda línea.
:::

::::analysis{title="Analysis"}

This paragraph introduces a comparison with another song.

:::concordance
## Source

A different song, first line.  
A different song, second line.

## Target

Otra canción, primera línea.  
Otra canción, segunda línea.
:::

And this paragraph discusses the comparison.

::::

:::notes{title="Translator's notes"}

These are some observations about the translation.

:::
`;

const blocks = parseDocument(markdown);
---

<BaseLayout title="Markdown Directives Prototype">
  <main class="container" style="padding-block: 3rem">
    <h1>Markdown Directives Prototype</h1>
    <DocumentContent blocks={blocks} />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
